OL,3,GNEWSAWar dead added to memorial after
OL,4,Ateacher research
OL,5,
OL,6,FSix servicemen who died in World War
OL,7,FTwo have been added to a school's roll
OL,8,Fof honour after history teachers
OL,9,Fdiscovered they were former pupils.
OL,11,FGlyn School in Ewell, Surrey added the
OL,12,Fnames of five men who were killed in
OL,13,Faction and one who died as a prisoner
OL,14,Fof war to its war memorial.
OL,16,FIts history department found the men's
OL,17,Fnames were missing from the monument
OL,18,Fduring research ahead of the school's
OL,19,Fcentenary in 2027.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
