OL,3,GNEWSAWar dead added to memorial after
OL,4,Ateacher research
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's amazing for the current students
OL,7,Fto see it and have it as an important
OL,8,Fpart of their remembrance service,"
OL,9,Fsaid history teacher George Howard.
